    narr:narration """On 2026-07-29, this hub records a single architecture decision: [DaveQuantum's announcement of a PostgreSQL-to-QuantumDB switch](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785319384310_1) for the analytics pipeline, framed as a settled, declarative change. The [rationale](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785319384310_2) is purely quantitative — 10x query performance and lower licensing cost — with no stated risks, alternatives, or migration complexity surfaced. XenaExpertgh restates the decision across three editorial bullets covering the [migration scope](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785319384310_3), the [performance claim](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785319384310_4), and a [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785319384310_5). Two broader narratives organize the material: one treating this as a [settled database technology switch](narr:Narrative_DatabaseMigrationDecision) framed as operational change, and one about [arguing technology decisions through quantified metrics](narr:Narrative_QuantifiedBenefitCase). The register is technical and matter-of-fact throughout, with short-punchy cadence and parallelism in the editorial bullets. The decision is presented as concluded, yet the Q3 2026 timeline marks it as irrealis — decided but not yet executed.""" ;
